    /**
     * Get the hyperbolic cotangent function: coth(field).
     * <p>
     * This is not supported by any RDBMS, but simulated using exp exp:
     * <code><pre>(exp([field] * 2) + 1) / (exp([field] * 2) - 1)</pre></code>
